  "tabs": {
    "background": {
      "label": "专业背景",
      "lede": "录井报告不是文学作品，是一份要签字的记录。它最要紧的属性不是「读起来顺」，而是「每一句都能查到一个数据源」。这决定了技术路线：不是让模型写报告，而是让模型填表、再由模型把表翻译成人话——顺序反过来，报告就失去了可核对性。",
      "judge": [
        { "label": "任务类型", "value": "结构化生成 + 检索", "desc": "槽位填充为主，润色为辅" },
        { "label": "数据门槛", "value": "报告模板 + 历史报告", "desc": "200 份以上可覆盖多数句式" },
        { "label": "可见收益", "value": "起草 45 → 8 min", "desc": "省的是搬运，不是判断" },
        { "label": "难度", "value": "中", "html": "<span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span>", "desc": "技术不难，边界要划清" }
      ],
      "sections": [
        {
          "no": 1,
          "en": "PROBLEM",
          "title": "当前做法与问题",
          "html": "<p>一份常规录井报告约 42 个字段：井号井段、钻时特征、岩屑描述、气测、荧光、钻井液、解释结论、试油建议。数据其实都在，只是散在六个地方。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 152' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='起草一份报告的时间分布'><rect width='620' height='152' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>TIME · 一份 45 分钟的报告，时间花在哪</text><text x='118' y='40' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>找数据</text><rect x='126' y='31' width='288' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='422' y='40' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>24 min · 53%</text><text x='118' y='68' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>复制与排版</text><rect x='126' y='59' width='120' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='254' y='68' font-size='8.2' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>10 min</text><text x='118' y='96' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>措辞</text><rect x='126' y='87' width='84' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='218' y='96' font-size='8.2' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>7 min</text><text x='118' y='124' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>核对</text><rect x='126' y='115' width='48' height='12' rx='2.5' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='182' y='124' font-size='8.2' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>4 min</text><text x='0' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>前两项占了七成，都是搬运。真正需要人的判断只有第三项</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　<b>被自动化掉的应该是前两项，不是最后一项</b>。这也是这个项目最容易做歪的地方：一旦让模型去「写结论」，省下来的四分钟换来的是签字人的全部重新核对。</p><p>而报告真正的用途，是三个月后有人来问「当时为什么判含油」时，能一句话查到依据。所以它必须带来源。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 178' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='三种句子的可核对性'><rect width='620' height='178' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='0' y='8' width='620' height='46' rx='7' fill='#f4f8f5' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.28'/><text x='12' y='26' font-size='8' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 有据可查</text><text x='12' y='44' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e'>钻时由 1.02 min/m 降至 0.62 min/m</text><rect x='470' y='18' width='138' height='16' rx='8' fill='#e6f1ec'/><text x='539' y='30' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51' text-anchor='middle'>来源 · 钻时曲线</text><text x='470' y='46' font-size='7.6' fill='#3f8560'>一个字都能查</text><rect x='0' y='62' width='620' height='46' rx='7' fill='#fdfaf0' stroke='#a97a1c' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='80' font-size='8' fill='#7d5a12' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 模糊表述</text><text x='12' y='98' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e'>钻时明显加快，物性较好</text><rect x='470' y='72' width='138' height='16' rx='8' fill='#f9efd7'/><text x='539' y='84' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12' text-anchor='middle'>来源 · 钻时曲线</text><text x='470' y='100' font-size='7.6' fill='#a97a1c'>查不到具体数</text><rect x='0' y='116' width='620' height='46' rx='7' fill='#fdf5f3' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='134' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>C · 无据结论</text><text x='12' y='152' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e'>本段为优质油气层，勘探前景良好</text><rect x='470' y='126' width='138' height='16' rx='8' fill='#f9e9e5'/><text x='539' y='138' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>无来源</text><text x='470' y='154' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51'>谁也说不清依据</text><text x='0' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>三种句子读起来都通顺。区别只在有没有那个小标签——所以标签不能省</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　<b>三种句子读起来一样顺</b>。C 类最危险：它不涉及任何数字，所以任何「数值准确率」都发现不了它，但它把结论从「含油性中等」拔高成了「优质油气层」。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 2,
          "en": "INTERVENTION",
          "title": "AI 能做什么",
          "html": "<p>核心判断：<b>不要「让模型写报告」，要「让模型填表再翻译」</b>。先把报告拆成槽位，每个槽位绑定数据源与口径，模型只负责把数值翻成句子——数值本身不允许模型产生。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 122' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='报告生成的五个环节'><rect width='620' height='122' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='8' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#9ba3a9'/><text x='18' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01 · SCHEMA</text><text x='18' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>模板结构化</text><text x='18' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>42 个字段</text><text x='18' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>每个有口径</text><path d='M121 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M129 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='131' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#41699b'/><text x='141' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02 · FETCH</text><text x='141' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>数据检索</text><text x='141' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>按字段取数</text><text x='141' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>带溯源路径</text><path d='M244 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M252 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='254' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#2f7d6b'/><text x='264' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03 · FILL</text><text x='264' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>槽位填充</text><text x='264' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>缺数据就写未测</text><text x='264' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>不许补零</text><path d='M367 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M375 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='377' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#b26a39'/><text x='387' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>04 · POLISH</text><text x='387' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>语言润色</text><text x='387' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>只改措辞</text><text x='387' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>数值锁定</text><path d='M490 55 h8' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.2'/><path d='M498 55 l-3.6 -3.4 v6.8 z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='82' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#767a2e' stroke-opacity='.35'/><rect x='500' y='14' width='112' height='3' rx='1.5' fill='#767a2e'/><text x='510' y='32' font-size='7.4' fill='#767a2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>05 · SIGN</text><text x='510' y='48' font-size='10.4' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>人工签发</text><text x='510' y='64' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>逐句核对</text><text x='510' y='77' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>修改回流</text><text x='310' y='114' font-size='8.4' fill='#9ba3a9' text-anchor='middle'>第 4 步是分水岭：润色只能改语言，不能改数值——这条约束要用程序执行，不能靠提示词</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　第 4 步是最容易被做歪的地方。<b>「请勿修改数字」写在提示词里不成立</b>——它是概率性的。真正可靠的做法是：模板里数值直接渲染，模型只负责返回措辞；或者生成后做数值校验，不一致就退回。</p><p>第 3 步的「缺数据写未测」也是硬规则：<b>模型最擅长的事，恰恰是把空白填得像有人填过</b>。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 3,
          "en": "DATA",
          "title": "你需要准备什么",
          "html": "<p style='margin-bottom:14px'>这个任务的数据特点是：<b>不需要标注，但需要「规范」</b>。历史报告就是语料，模板就是约束。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 168' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='42 个字段的来源结构'><rect width='620' height='168' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>FIELD PROVENANCE · 42 个字段从哪来</text><rect x='0' y='26' width='413' height='22' rx='3' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='415' y='26' width='80' height='22' rx='3' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.8'/><rect x='497' y='26' width='67' height='22' rx='3' fill='#7e5a8d' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='206' y='41' font-size='8.6' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>31 个字段 · 结构化来源</text><text x='455' y='41' font-size='8.2' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>6 · 半结构</text><text x='531' y='41' font-size='7.8' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>5 · 只靠人</text><text x='0' y='66' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>井号井段 · 钻时 · 岩屑比例 · 气测组分 · 荧光级别 · 钻井液参数 · 试油层段</text><text x='0' y='84' font-size='8.2' fill='#b26a39'>半结构：分选、磨圆、含油产状 —— 有分级口径，但要人判断</text><text x='0' y='102' font-size='8.2' fill='#7e5a8d'>只靠人：解释结论 · 异常说明 · 建议 —— 这 5 个不该让模型写</text><rect x='0' y='114' width='620' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='0' y='132' font-size='8.2' fill='#242b2e'>结论很清楚：74% 的字段可以完全自动化，14% 可以辅助，12% 必须留给人</text><text x='0' y='150' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>把「12%」也自动化掉，就是这类项目最常见的失败方式</text><text x='0' y='164' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' opacity='0'>.</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　<b>74% 可以自动化，12% 必须留给人</b>。前者的价值是省时间，后者的价值是保命——这两件事不能混在一个模型里做。</p><p style='margin-top:12px'><b>数据准备清单</b></p><p>· <b>报告模板与字段清单</b>：42 个字段的名称、单位、口径、取值范围<br>· <b>历史报告</b>：200 份以上，用于学习句式与常见表述（<b>只学措辞，不学数值</b>）<br>· <b>数据源接口</b>：钻时、岩屑、气测、荧光、钻井液，字段级可取<br>· <b>解释规范</b>：级别定义、术语表，用于约束输出用词</p><p><b>最容易被忽略的一条</b>　「术语表」看起来只是文档，其实是<b>验收工具</b>：定义了「荧光 3 级」到底指什么，才谈得上「模型用词是否合规」。没有它，两个人的报告用词差异会被当成模型错误。</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 4,
          "en": "DIFFICULTY",
          "title": "技术难度与参考方向",
          "html": "<div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:8px'><span class='dtag' data-d='中'>难度 中</span><span style='font-size:12px;color:#79828a'>技术上不难；难在划清「谁写什么」的边界。</span></div><svg viewBox='0 0 620 158' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='难度分解'><rect width='620' height='158' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY HARD · 难度来自哪一项</text><text x='102' y='36' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>数据可得性</text><rect x='110' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='27' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='36' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>数据都在系统里</text><text x='102' y='61' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>标签成本</text><rect x='110' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><rect x='158' y='52' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='185' y='61' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>历史报告即语料</text><text x='102' y='86' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>幻觉风险</text><rect x='110' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='77' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>数字与结论都会被编</text><text x='102' y='111' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>可追溯性</text><rect x='110' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='134' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><rect x='158' y='102' width='19' height='10' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.9'/><text x='185' y='111' font-size='8.2' fill='#9ba3a9'>每句都要能查</text><rect x='110' y='128' width='300' height='1' fill='#e9e4d8'/><text x='110' y='146' font-size='8.2' fill='#79828a'>两项 3 格都在「生成的可靠性」上 → 用架构解决，不用调模型解决</text><text x='418' y='36' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>难度分级</text><rect x='418' y='44' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#3f8560' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='53' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>低</text><rect x='418' y='60' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#a97a1c' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='69' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>中</text><rect x='418' y='76' width='10' height='10' rx='2' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.5'/><text x='433' y='85' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>高</text><text x='418' y='118' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>定位建议</text><text x='418' y='133' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>做「起草」不做「签发」</text><text x='418' y='146' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>做「填表」不做「发挥」</text><text x='418' y='159' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>目标是让人少抄，不是让人少想</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　两项 3 格都在「生成的可靠性」上，而可靠性<b>是架构问题，不是模型能力问题</b>：锁数值、强制溯源、缺数据写未测——这三条做到了，小模型也够用；做不到，最大的模型也白搭。</p><p><b>定位建议</b>　<b>做「起草」，不做「签发」；做「填表」，不做「发挥」</b>。这个边界一旦模糊，验收标准就会变成「读起来像不像人写的」——而这个标准永远争不出结果。</p><p><b>可借鉴的通用技术</b>　结构化生成 · 检索增强 · 模板约束 · 溯源标注</p>"
        },
        {
          "no": 5,
          "en": "WHAT · WHY · HOW",
          "title": "AI 方法拆解：用了什么、为什么、怎么起作用",
          "html": "<p>这个案例最能说明一件事：<b>同一个模型，输出「结构化槽位」和输出「一段自由文本」，可靠性差一个量级</b>。区别不在模型，在输出空间有多大。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 230' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='WHAT WHY HOW 三联'><rect width='620' height='230' fill='#ffffff'/><rect x='6' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='18' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHAT · 用了什么</text><text x='18' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>模板 + 检索 + 润色</text><text x='18' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>三件东西，各有分工：</text><text x='18' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>① 模板：固定输出结构</text><text x='18' y='86' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>② 检索：逐字段取数带路径</text><text x='18' y='100' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>③ 模型：只做措辞转换</text><rect x='18' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#41699b' fill-opacity='.1' stroke='#41699b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='47' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>01</text><text x='47' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>结构化</text><rect x='82' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='111' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#2f7d6b' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>02</text><text x='111' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>取数</text><rect x='146' y='112' width='58' height='44' rx='6' fill='#f8ecdf' stroke='#b26a39' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='175' y='128' font-size='7.4' fill='#b26a39' text-anchor='middle' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>03</text><text x='175' y='144' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e' text-anchor='middle'>生成</text><text x='18' y='176' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>注意 ① ② 里没有模型。它们把模型的</text><text x='18' y='190' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9'>输出空间从「任意中文」压到「一句话」</text><text x='18' y='204' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>——这是可靠性的来源。</text><text x='18' y='222' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>输出空间越小，幻觉越无处藏身</text><rect x='212' y='6' width='198' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='224' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>WHY · 为什么</text><text x='224' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>自由生成会「避重就轻」</text><text x='224' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>它没法编造精确数字时，就改写定性</text><text x='224' y='72' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>描述——于是报告变顺了，信息变少了。</text><text x='224' y='96' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>应填数字</text><rect x='232' y='87' width='150' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.8'/><text x='390' y='96' font-size='8' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>19</text><text x='224' y='122' font-size='8.8' fill='#4d565b' text-anchor='end'>自由生成实际给出</text><rect x='232' y='113' width='40' height='11' rx='2.5' fill='#b05a51' fill-opacity='.85'/><text x='280' y='122' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>5</text><text x='224' y='148' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>数字少了，错误率反而看起来不高——</text><text x='224' y='162' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>因为它把能错的都改成了形容词。</text><text x='224' y='184' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>这就是为什么必须按「应填多少」验收，</text><text x='224' y='198' font-size='8.4' fill='#242b2e'>而不是按「写了多少对不对」验收。</text><text x='224' y='218' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>分母必须固定，否则自由生成总能赢指标</text><rect x='418' y='6' width='196' height='218' rx='8' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='430' y='24' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>HOW · 怎么起作用</text><text x='430' y='42' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#242b2e'>把不可核对变成可核对</text><text x='430' y='58' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>同一段钻时，两种写法：</text><rect x='430' y='68' width='172' height='34' rx='5' fill='#f9e9e5' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='82' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>钻时明显加快</text><text x='440' y='95' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>→ 核对时无从下手</text><rect x='430' y='108' width='172' height='34' rx='5' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='440' y='122' font-size='8.2' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>1.02 → 0.62 min/m</text><text x='440' y='135' font-size='7.8' fill='#79828a'>→ 两秒钟能核完</text><text x='430' y='160' font-size='8.4' fill='#79828a'>再加三条硬约束：</text><rect x='430' y='168' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 174 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='178' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>数值由模板渲染，模型不碰</text><rect x='430' y='188' width='12' height='12' rx='3' fill='#e7f3ea' stroke='#3f8560'/><path d='M433 194 l2.4 3 l3.6 -6' stroke='#3f8560' stroke-width='1.6' fill='none' stroke-linecap='round'/><text x='450' y='198' font-size='8.4' fill='#4d565b'>未取到数 → 写「未测」</text><text x='430' y='218' font-size='7.8' fill='#242b2e'>三条都不是提示词，是代码。</text></svg><p><b>图注</b>　左：用了什么。中：为什么非它不可，以及「分母必须固定」这个验收陷阱。右：它凭什么有用。<b>最后那句「三条都不是提示词，是代码」是这个案例最该带走的一句话</b>。</p>"
        }
      ]
    },

    "workflow": {
      "label": "案例流程",
      "title": "案例：一个录井队的报告起草试点",
      "lead": [
        "目标：把单井报告的**起草时间从 45 分钟压到 10 分钟以内**，同时保证**可追溯率 100%**、数值准确率 100%。",
        "注意第二个指标不是「提升」，而是「不许下降」——它是底线，不是目标。汇报时这两件事必须分开说。"
      ],
      "stats": [
        ["字段", "42"],
        ["历史报告", "260 份"],
        ["起草时间", "45 → 8 min"],
        ["可追溯率", "100%"]
      ],
      "steps": [
        {
          "name": "报告模板结构化",
          "role": "工程环节",
          "do": "把报告的段落拆成 42 个字段，每个字段写明单位、口径、取值范围与「缺数据时怎么填」。",
          "effect": "让报告变成一张表",
          "trap": "只拆不解口径，两个队对「荧光 3 级」理解不同——**字段再多，口径不统一也没法自动生成**"
        },
        {
          "name": "数据源映射与取数",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "为每个字段绑定数据源与取数规则，取数时记录来源路径（哪条曲线、哪个区间、哪次测量）。",
          "effect": "每个值都能查到来处",
          "trap": "只取值不记路径，报告就成了黑箱——**而「能查到来源」正是这份报告的全部价值**"
        },
        {
          "name": "槽位填充与缺失标注",
          "role": "算法核心",
          "do": "按模板逐字段填值；取不到数的字段明确写「未测 / 无记录」，不许用邻近值或零填充。",
          "effect": "让空白保持可见",
          "trap": "模型倾向把缺失填得像有人填过——**一个编造的密度值，会让整份报告作废**"
        },
        {
          "name": "语言润色与数值锁定",
          "role": "效果关键",
          "do": "模型只负责把「1.02 → 0.62」翻成一句话；数值由模板渲染，生成后做一次数值校验，不一致即退回。",
          "effect": "可读性上去了，数值没变",
          "trap": "把「不许改数字」写进提示词，是概率性的——**它是这条流水线上唯一必须用代码保证的环节**"
        },
        {
          "name": "人工签发与修改回流",
          "role": "闭环",
          "do": "解释员逐句签发，改动的句子记录「改了什么、为什么」，作为下一轮模板与句式优化的输入。",
          "effect": "模板越用越贴合实际",
          "trap": "只记录改了哪句、不记录为什么改，模板就会在错误的方向上越来越精细"
        }
      ],
      "metrics": {
        "title": "五步要点：每一步产出什么、验收什么",
        "html": "<p>下面五张图对应上面五步。<b>第 3 步与第 4 步是两条硬约束</b>：一条管「不许编」，一条管「不许改」。它们都不是模型能力问题。</p><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第一步 模板结构化'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 01 · 模板结构化 · 42 个字段，每个都要有口径</text><rect x='0' y='24' width='290' height='82' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='12' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>字段定义（节选）</text><text x='12' y='58' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>荧光级别 · 枚举 1—4</text><text x='12' y='72' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>全烃峰值 · % · 两位小数</text><text x='12' y='86' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>钻井液密度 · g/cm³ · 两位</text><text x='12' y='100' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>试油层段 · m · 起止两值</text><rect x='306' y='24' width='314' height='82' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#a97a1c' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='318' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#7d5a12' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>口径不一致的代价</text><rect x='318' y='50' width='140' height='20' rx='4' fill='#f9efd7'/><text x='388' y='64' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12' text-anchor='middle'>A 队：3 级 = 明显</text><rect x='466' y='50' width='140' height='20' rx='4' fill='#f9efd7'/><text x='536' y='64' font-size='7.8' fill='#7d5a12' text-anchor='middle'>B 队：3 级 = 较强</text><text x='318' y='88' font-size='8' fill='#b05a51'>同一段，两个队填出两个级别</text><text x='318' y='102' font-size='8' fill='#242b2e'>这不是模型错，是模板没定义清楚</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第二步 取数并记录来源路径'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 02 · 取数留痕 · 值 + 路径，缺一不可</text><rect x='0' y='24' width='278' height='82' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 只取值</text><text x='12' y='60' font-size='9.4' fill='#242b2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>全烃峰值 = 11.2 %</text><text x='12' y='82' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>签字时无法核对</text><text x='12' y='98' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>说不清是哪条曲线、哪个区间</text><rect x='294' y='24' width='326' height='82' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='306' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 值 + 路径</text><text x='306' y='58' font-size='9' fill='#242b2e' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>全烃峰值 = 11.2 %</text><text x='306' y='74' font-size='7.8' fill='#4d565b'>来源：气测表 · C1 通道 · 3291.5 m · 14:22</text><text x='306' y='92' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>两秒钟核完</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：报告里每个数值都能点到它的原始记录</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第三步 缺失标注'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 03 · 缺失标注 · 空白必须看得见</text><rect x='0' y='24' width='290' height='82' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#b05a51' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='12' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#b05a51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>A · 补得像真的</text><text x='12' y='58' font-size='8.6' fill='#242b2e'>钻井液密度 1.42 g/cm³</text><text x='12' y='72' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>但这一班根本没测密度</text><text x='12' y='90' font-size='7.8' fill='#b05a51'>值来自邻井 / 上一次测量 / 编的</text><rect x='306' y='24' width='314' height='82' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.3'/><text x='318' y='40' font-size='7.6' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>B · 明确写未测</text><text x='318' y='58' font-size='8.6' fill='#242b2e'>钻井液密度 <tspan font-weight='600'>未测</tspan></text><text x='318' y='74' font-size='7.8' fill='#4d565b'>（本班无密度测量记录）</text><text x='318' y='92' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>解释员一眼看到缺口 → 去补测</text><text x='0' y='114' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>验收：缺失字段的数量在报告首页可见，不许静默填充</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第四步 数值锁定与校验'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 04 · 数值锁定 · 提示词管不住，代码管得住</text><rect x='0' y='24' width='196' height='82' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='12' y='40' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>模板（数值渲染）</text><text x='12' y='60' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>1.02 → 0.62 min/m</text><text x='12' y='78' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>19 个数值并入槽</text><text x='12' y='96' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>数值不经过模型</text><path d='M204 62h26' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.3'/><path d='M230 62l-6-3.4v6.8z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='242' y='24' width='176' height='82' rx='7' fill='#fdfcf9' stroke='#e9e4d8'/><text x='254' y='40' font-size='7.4' fill='#9ba3a9' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>模型（只给措辞）</text><text x='254' y='60' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>「钻时由 {a} 降至 {b}，</text><text x='254' y='76' font-size='8.2' fill='#4d565b'>降幅 {c}%」</text><text x='254' y='96' font-size='7.8' fill='#235f51'>返回句式，不回数值</text><path d='M426 62h26' stroke='#c9c2b0' stroke-width='1.3'/><path d='M452 62l-6-3.4v6.8z' fill='#c9c2b0'/><rect x='464' y='24' width='156' height='82' rx='7' fill='#ffffff' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.35'/><text x='476' y='40' font-size='7.4' fill='#235f51' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace'>校验后出稿</text><text x='476' y='60' font-size='8.2' fill='#235f51'>数值比对：一致 ✓</text><text x='476' y='78' font-size='8.2' fill='#b05a51'>不一致 → 退回重生成</text><text x='476' y='96' font-size='7.8' fill='#9ba3a9'>这道闸门不能省</text></svg><svg viewBox='0 0 620 116' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='第五步 签发与回流'><rect width='620' height='116' fill='#ffffff'/><text x='0' y='12' font-size='7.4' fill='#3f8560' font-family='ui-monospace,monospace' letter-spacing='.06em'>STEP 05 · 签发回流 · 记「为什么改」，不只记「改了」</text><rect x='0' y='24' width='620' height='20' rx='4' fill='#f5f2ea'/><rect x='0' y='24' width='470' height='20' rx='4' fill='#2f7d6b' fill-opacity='.55'/><rect x='470' y='24' width='150' height='20' rx='4' fill='#b26a39' fill-opacity='.6'/><text x='235' y='38' font-size='8.2' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>一次通过 76%</text><text x='545' y='38' font-size='8.2' fill='#ffffff' text-anchor='middle' font-weight='600'>改动 24%</text><text x='0' y='62' font-size='8' fill='#4d565b'>改动里最常见的三类：措辞不合本地习惯 · 缺数据判断有误 · 结论级别需要人调</text><text x='0' y='80' font-size='8' fill='#79828a'>第一类进句式库，第二类进字段规则，第三类<bold>永远留给人</bold></text><rect x='0' y='88' width='620' height='22' rx='4' fill='#e6f1ec' stroke='#2f7d6b' stroke-opacity='.25'/><text x='12' y='103' font-size='8' fill='#235f51'>验收：每条改动都带原因，且能按原因归类统计</text></svg><p style='margin-top:14px'><b>怎么算「生成得对」</b></p><table class='dtable'><thead><tr><th>指标</th><th>定义</th><th>本例取值</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>字段覆盖率</td><td>42 个字段中被填到的比例</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>数值准确率</td><td>19 个数值中与原始记录一致的比例</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>可追溯率</td><td>每个数值都能点到来源的比例</td><td>100%</td></tr><tr><td>起草时间</td><td>单井报告从打开模板到提交</td><td>8 min</td></tr><tr><td>人工改动率</td><td>被签发人修改的句子占比</td><td>24%</td></tr></tbody></table><p style='margin-top:12px'>前三个是<b>底线指标</b>，不许下降；后两个是<b>收益指标</b>，用来证明值得做。<b>把两类混在一起汇报，是这个项目最容易失控的地方</b>——一旦收益好看，底线的松动就会被忽略。</p>"
      },
